# ============================================================
# ResQNet Frontend — npm configuration
# ============================================================

# Platform-specific optional binary packages:
# Rollup and esbuild ship separate optional packages for every OS/arch
# (linux-x64, darwin-arm64, win32-x64, etc.). npm will skip the packages
# that don't match the current platform — WARN messages about missing
# optional deps are expected and harmless. These are NOT errors.
#
# npm ci will correctly install only the platform-native binary needed.
